msgctxt "#32050"
msgid "Log Uploader"
msgstr "Nalagalnik dnevnika"

msgctxt "#32051"
msgid "This module helps with debugging and troubleshooting by retrieving logs, various xml, and config information from your system and uploading them in a single file.[CR]Once uploading is complete, you are provided with a URL which you can share on the OSMC forums.[CR]The information stored in the URL will help others diagnose your issue and decrease the amount of time it takes to find a resolution."
msgstr "Ta modul pomaga pri razhroščevanju in odpravljanju težav tako, da pridobi dnevnike, različne xml in podatke o konfiguraciji iz vašega sistema ter jih naloži v eno datoteko.[CR]Ko je nalaganje končano, dobite URL, ki ga lahko delite na forumih OSMC.[CR]Podatki, shranjeni v URL-ju, bodo drugim pomagali diagnosticirati vašo težavo in skrajšali čas, potreben za iskanje rešitve."

msgctxt "#32052"
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Omrežje"

msgctxt "#32053"
msgid "This is network settings, it contains settings for the network."
msgstr "To so omrežne nastavitve, vsebujejo nastavitve za omrežje."

msgctxt "#32054"
msgid "Pi Config"
msgstr "Konfiguracija Pi"

msgctxt "#32055"
msgid "The Raspberry Pi doesn't have a conventional BIOS. System configuration parameters are stored in a \"config.txt\" file. For more detail, visit http://elinux.org/RPiconfig[CR]This settings module allows you to edit your config.txt from within OSMC using a graphical interface.[CR][CR]The module includes:[CR]- display rotation[CR]- hdmi_safe & hdmi_boost[CR]- hdmi_group & hdmi_mode[CR]- function to save edid to file[CR]- sdtv_mode & sdtv_aspect[CR]- GPU memory split[CR]- MPG2 & WVC1 licences (including status)[CR]- your Pi's serial number[CR][CR]Finally, there is a Config Editor that will allow you to quickly add, edit, or delete lines in your config.txt.[CR][CR]Overclock settings are set using the Pi Overclock module."
msgstr "Raspberry Pi nima običajnega BIOS-a. Parametri sistemske konfiguracije so shranjeni v datoteki \"config.txt\". Za več podrobnosti obiščite http://elinux.org/RPiconfig[CR]Ta nastavitveni modul vam omogoča urejanje vaše config.txt znotraj OSMC z uporabo grafičnega vmesnika.[CR][CR]Modul vključuje:[CR]- vrtenje zaslona[CR]- hdmi_safe & hdmi_boost[CR]- hdmi_group & hdmi_mode[CR]- funkcija za shranjevanje edid v datoteko[CR]- sdtv_mode & sdtv_aspect[CR]- razdelitev pomnilnika GPU[CR]- licenci MPG2 in WVC1 (vključno status)[CR]- serijska številka vašega Pi-ja[CR][CR]Končno je na voljo še urejevalnik konfiguracij, ki vam omogoča hitro dodajanje, urejanje ali brisanje vrstic v datoteki config.txt.[CR][CR]Nastavitve za overclock se nastavijo z modulom Pi Overclock."

